rg0 fzuwlxe fhwpw40 f1h6fez2 f5ybzmn f1yzfvpk f16v1stg f8jclj0 f1c2gnh0 fry9c0a f1dwawj4 f1hw1bew fdmtvqg f1uehrap f1o2z0la f6hli9u f7kjtdb f17o8cpj f1oaoifb f18mpl1h f1y1vkt fij1kcj fhcms6v f8s4fs1 f1a8yah9 f1950bfk fxc7pbt f1wwqd0h f1mdenie fb5p750 f1ud1yn8 fq26vao f1c0fisw f9w4ola fw4wpu5 f1aekw10 fn7q2vw fm5yq3g fag8tdu f17aevfr f58f5vt f102mg56 f126zdz7 fyvuiz7 f10ud6hq f1u8wd2w fxy0hb4 ffdz3f9 f1vh42m0 f197g5h6 f1bzjmsn fj6y084 f9909mp fiz0p2d f1vkdkjs f19n0e5 f1eldvup f11ob4g2 f1jakm6c fe0pja7\"><h1>FR Market Vocabulary</h1>\n<div class=\"___5wvz9a0 ftgm304 f1oy3dpc fm6nont f48hbct\" role=\"presentation\" data-stable-ignore=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tabster=\"{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"___1dmoc29 f10pi13n ftgm304 f1enuhaj fdclmfp f1nbblvp fat0sn4 f1ov4xf1 fekwl8i f1lmfglv f1oz7aqm f1abmfm4 f1w619qj f16h0jq8\">\nFrançais | English | Русский\n-- | -- | --\nAgence | Branch | Филиал\nAgence commerciale | Sales Branch | Торговый филиал\nBack-office | Back Office | Бэк-офис\nClient comptant | Cash Customer | Клиент с оплатой наличными\nClient à terme | Account Customer | Клиент с отсрочкой платежа\nEncours client | Customer Exposure | Клиентская задолженность\nPlafond de crédit | Credit Limit | Кредитный лимит\nCommande client | Customer Order | Клиентский заказ\nLigne de commande | Order Line | Строка заказа\nArticle | Product Item | Товарная позиция\nProduit teinté | Tinted Product | Колерованный продукт\nTeinte | Tint / Color Formula | Колеровка\nLivraison | Delivery | Поставка\nLivraison directe | Direct Delivery | Прямая поставка\nFournisseur | Supplier | Поставщик\nAchat fournisseur | Supplier Purchase | Закупка у поставщика\nRéception fournisseur | Goods Receipt | Приемка товара\nBon de préparation | Picking Slip | Лист комплектации\nBon de livraison | Delivery Note | Товарная накладная\nFacture | Invoice | Счет-фактура\nAvoir | Credit Note | Кредит-нота / корректировочный счет\nRetour | Return | Возврат\nPaiement | Payment | Оплата\nAcompte | Deposit | Предоплата\nReprise d'acompte | Deposit Reversal | Зачет предоплаты\nEncaissement | Cash Collection | Инкассация / получение оплаты\nReliquat | Backorder | Недопоставка / отложенный заказ\nStock | Inventory | Запас\nRéservation de stock | Stock Reservation | Резервирование запаса\nDisponibilité stock | Stock Availability | Наличие на складе\nRéapprovisionnement | Replenishment | Пополнение запаса\nQualité du stock | Stock Quality | Качество запасов\nGros runners | Fast Moving Products | Ходовые товары\nInventaire | Inventory Count | Инвентаризация\nTransfert de stock | Stock Transfer | Перемещение запасов\n\n</div></div>\n<p> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BD14F8293-5168-48BD-BAF1-33DB857401B8%7D&amp;file=Phase%201%20POS%20GAPs%20workbook.xlsx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Phase 1 PO...s workbook | Excel]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>TOP 10 Processes Existing in the French Market</h1>\n<p>Based on the DALI documentation, Philippe's explanations, and the Elevate gap workbook, these are the <strong>10 most important business processes</strong> to understand.</p>\n<h2>1. Customer Order Entry (SCO)</h2>\n<p>Creation of customer orders including stock checks, supplier sourcing, backorders, pricing and delivery decisions.</p>\n<p><strong>Priority: CRITICAL</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>2. Counter Sales Order Entry (SCX)</h2>\n<p>Fast sales process for products immediately available in stock.</p>\n<p><strong>Priority: CRITICAL</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>3. Customer Pricing Management</h2>\n<p>Application of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tariffs</li>\n<li>Customer agreements</li>\n<li>Discounts</li>\n<li>Promotions</li>\n<li>Price delegations</li>\n<li>PriceFX rules</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Priority: CRITICAL</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a>, <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BD14F8293-5168-48BD-BAF1-33DB857401B8%7D&amp;file=Phase%201%20POS%20GAPs%20workbook.xlsx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Phase 1 PO...s workbook | Excel]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>4. Supplier Procurement Process</h2>\n<p>Creation of purchase orders when products are unavailable in stock.</p>\n<p><strong>Priority: HIGH</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>5. Backorder (Reliquat) Management</h2>\n<p>Management of unavailable products and allocation after supplier receipt.</p>\n<p><strong>Priority: HIGH</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>6. Stock Management</h2>\n<p>Including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stock availability</li>\n<li>Stock reservations</li>\n<li>Replenishment</li>\n<li>Fast movers management</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Priority: HIGH</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a>, <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BD14F8293-5168-48BD-BAF1-33DB857401B8%7D&amp;file=Phase%201%20POS%20GAPs%20workbook.xlsx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Phase 1 PO...s workbook | Excel]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>7. Tinting Process (Produits Teintés)</h2>\n<p>Creation and sale of custom colored paint products.</p>\n<p>Philippe explicitly identified this as an important variant requiring dedicated analysis. <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>8. Delivery Validation Process (VAL)</h2>\n<p>Transformation of prepared goods into delivery notes and customer shipments.</p>\n<p><strong>Priority: MEDIUM-HIGH</strong> <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>9. Payment &amp; Deposit Management</h2>\n<p>Including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deposits (acomptes)</li>\n<li>Deposit reversals</li>\n<li>Multiple payments</li>\n<li>Credit notes</li>\n<li>Returns</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Philippe highlighted this area as potentially more sensitive than invoicing itself. <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>10. Customer Credit Control</h2>\n<p>Including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Credit limits</li>\n<li>Outstanding balance</li>\n<li>Credit insurance checks</li>\n<li>Order blocks and approvals</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Priority: HIGH</strong> because it directly affects order acceptance and processing. <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p>\n<h1>Recommended Learning Order</h1>\n<p>If you want to become productive quickly before the France visit:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>SCO</li>\n<li>SCX</li>\n<li>Pricing &amp; Price Delegation</li>\n<li>Credit Control</li>\n<li>Backorders (Reliquats)</li>\n<li>Supplier Procurement</li>\n<li>Tinting Process</li>\n<li>Stock Management</li>\n<li>VAL / Delivery</li>\n<li>Payments &amp; Deposits</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This sequence follows the priorities repeatedly emphasized by Vagnon, Philippe: understand <strong>order entry first</strong>, then pricing and business rules, then inventory and downstream processes. <a href=\"https://ppgindustriesinceu-my.sharepoint.com/personal/pavlovsky_ppg_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B08D79075-4435-45A7-803E-EB2B6188E644%7D&amp;file=Analyse%20-%2010%20Nov.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true\">[Analyse - 10 Nov | Word]</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-tabster=\"{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:false}}\" role=\"toolbar\" class=\"fai-CopilotMessage__actions rmlvq19 ___7qar2c0 fcthzvy\"><i tabindex=\"0\" role=\"none\" data-tabster-dummy=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: fixed; height: 1px; width: 1px; opacity: 0.001; z-index: -1; content-visibility: hidden; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"></i><div class=\"___1akvep3 f22iagw f1vx9l62 fdr99fa fly5x3f\"><div class=\"___m91pmt0 f19gb1f4 f22iagw f1063pyq f122n59 fni485r\"><div data-testid=\"CopyButtonContainerTestId\" data-stable-ignore=\"true\" class=\"___kpik3k0 f22iagw f122n59 fbhxue7 f19gb1f4 fni485r\"><div class=\"___he637h0 f22iagw f122n59 fbhxue7 fsbu5mz fni485r\"><div class=\"___kpik3k0 f22iagw f122n59 fbhxue7 f19gb1f4 fni485r\"><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tabster=\"{&quot;focusable&quot;:{&quot;isDefault&quot;:true}}\" aria-label=\"Copy Response\" data-stable-ignore=\"true\" data-testid=\"CopyButtonTestId\" class=\"fui-Button r1f29ykk fai-bebop ___1l3ccvm f1c21dwh f19n0e5 fcrct79 f1s2uweq fr80ssc f1ukrpxl fecsdlb f1mwwx2u ft1hn21 fuxngvv fuqjl61 fu0xp67 fhvnf4x fb6swo4 f1klyf7k f232fm2 f1j25eq3 f1nhwcv0 f1gm6xmp f1l25zcy f1v3eptx fivsta0 fd4bjan f3m6zum f44lkw9 f1062rbf f1angvds fk8j09s fdw0yi8 f16k8034 f18ktai2 f17fgpbq f44c6la f3bhgqh figsok6 f8hki3x f1d2448m f1bjia2o ffh67wi f1pxyubt f1dxfoyt f1nwcc8c f1szoe96 f1d2rq10 fg8d833\"><span class=\"fui-Button__icon rywnvv2\"><svg class=\"fui-Icon fui-Icon-filled ___yt8pzc0 fjseox fez10in f1dd5bof\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fui-icon=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 11.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3.5 3.5h1.45a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.45 2h-4A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3 14.5v-6A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5.5 6H7zM14.5 3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 17 5.5v6a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5h-4A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 8 11.5v-6A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 10.5 3z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><svg class=\"fui-Icon fui-Icon-r